-- Bodies on the device were picked by the app's own copy of the web's choice
-- of content, which had drifted from it; the server now sends the content to
-- show. Marking every body out of date (entries' body_version starts at 1) has
-- the background download replace them, while they stay readable offline
-- until it does. Summaries stay: the server made them from its own content,
-- not the app's pick.
UPDATE entry_body SET body_version = 0;
